Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.09,0:01:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Orichalco serves me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and all of its ancient powers\Nrest on my side of the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,strengthening my dark magician girl the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Knight with 500\Nextra attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it can break free\Nfrom your crystal seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to my dragon?\NIt's not what I've done, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,what you've done by playing\Nthat magic card guess i should
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,have warned you to mayas and\Nthe orichalcos don't mix but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,at least your dark side's been\Nset free what have i unleashed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.21,0:02:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a fool to hand me this card,\Nfor when you lose your soul, it will be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,sealed for all eternity where it belongs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,now i activate hand control all i need
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to do is correctly guess the name of a\Ncard in your hand and i can activate it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I gave you the Necromancy card,\NI know you're holding. Now it's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Necromancy allows me to bring four\Nmonsters back from my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So return to me, Big\NShell Gardener, Berfoment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Gazelle the King of Mythical\NBeasts, and Curry Babylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll sacrifice Gazelle and Berfoment,\Nso I can summon my Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll separate my Curio Babylon into
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the five Karibu brothers\NI used to create it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my monsters, feel the\Npower of the Orykalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark energy of the Orykalcos enhances\Nmy creatures with 500 extra points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I combine my Kareebo's once\Nagain to form Karee Babylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,each of my furry friends gained 500 extra
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,points for a grand total\Nof 2,500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of that power was\Nabsorbed by my Karee Babylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.49,0:03:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one powerful\Ncotton ball you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.11,0:03:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to the\Npower of the Obelisk! Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The power comes from the darkness in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Obelisk! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He played it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care where this power came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is it's mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that you have a\Nmonster in your graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,your magic card loses its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm far from done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magician hasn't had\Nhis chance to make you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Aid to the Doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A handy magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to stop your Dark Magician's\Nattack before it reaches my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm willing to send two of\Nmy cards to the graveyard as payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that Orichalcos\Nthingy on Yugi's forehead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys just missed the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you two fill us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust these twerps\Nas far as I can throw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my best buddy's got that freaky\Nthing on his head, and I want answers now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take your paws\Noff me and try asking nicely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's go time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.01,0:05:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the seal of Orichalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi got it from that big muscle\Nguy and then activated it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.39,0:05:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows that card's evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to know that all this\Ntime you've been hiding your true self?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You derive your powers from\Ndarkness and you always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you jealous because the seal\Nof Aurichalcos resides with me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's your soul that's\Non the line this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should have thought twice\Nbefore turning that magic card over to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal may be strong,\Nbut I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have complete trust in my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My guardian may be\Ngone, but he'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my monster rebirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows\Nme to bring one monster
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,back from my graveyard\Nand place it in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose Guardian Grawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed that monster\Nonce and I'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now finish your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card\Nface down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate my Swords\Nof Revealing Light Magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.55,0:07:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So your monsters can't\Nattack for three turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi loses, I call\Ndibs on his Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show some\Ncompassion for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.19,0:07:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me take his Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your swords mean nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,for I play Catapult Turtle by\Nsacrificing my Big Shield Gardener!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.71,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I use my turtle's special\Nability to catapult any monster
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose from my side of the field\Ndirectly at your life points, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You've activated my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.47,0:07:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lemon Tribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It changes the rules of the\Ncompetition by limiting the number
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,of monsters each player can\Nsacrifice to one monster per turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate Nightmare Binding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your curry Babylon just lost 800\Npoints, but they didn't go to waste,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,because those attack points\Ngot added to my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And to top it off, your oversized\Ndust bunny can't be sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Insult my monsters, all you like, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of the Oricaltos\Nbehind me, I can't be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he's useless, I'll\Nsacrifice my Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And by using the special\Nability of my Catapult Turtle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll damage your life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,my Dark Magician can\Nactually serve a purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,by strengthening my Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like the Yugi I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just about to lose\Nthe duel and your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,One more blast from my\Ncatapult turtle and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.01,0:09:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play this and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all I have to do is destroy one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And this duel's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose my very own Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seal of Orichalcos is in play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So the monsters on the field are real!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't sacrifice\Nthe Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.81,0:09:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire, catapult!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my shrink card. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,not that card Dark magician girl\Nloses half her points He saved himself
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive But all you\Ndid was prolong your
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventual downfall. You'll\Nnever escape the seal it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,seems your swords of revealing light just
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,expired so once i sacrifice\Nanother of my monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.39,0:10:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,your spirit will be absorbed by the seal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,trapping you forever the\Nworld's strongest force
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Answers to me. Oh man,\Nit looks like Yugi's got
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,this duel in the bag you\Ngo yugi nice moves huh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's brainwashed. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sacrificing his monsters left\Nand right and talking about power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Yugi's style of dueling at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That Ori Kalko's thing\Nis messing with his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like it did to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That card is evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you the seal\Nwould reveal the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is you, wicked,\Ngreedy, and full of hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.31,0:11:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the Oricolkos reveals all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.53,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And just as I suspected,\Nyou're evil, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As time passes, the darkness grows. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me, all you\Nhave to do is look around the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,See what you've done to your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,At one time they were pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But now they're evil shadow creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I really do all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My Kariwos!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You deceived me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose to play the Seal of Orykalkos\Neven at the cost of losing, Timaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lust for power\Ndestroyed a valuable monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a truly dark individual would have\Nsuch a blatant disregard for his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.89,0:12:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's gonna lose in this next\Nround and this nightmare'll be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one card that can save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Celestial Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:13:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Use my sword. I play Guardian Iatos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the monster I've\Nbeen sensing all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate your special ability, Iatos!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of Celestial Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing control!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrgh! Arrgh! Urgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My guardian Iatos has the\Nability to remove monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,from your card graveyard and\Nabsorb their attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:13:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Too little too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see who's up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magician girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Next it'll take your favorite monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Next victims are your Big Shield\NGardner, Gazelle, and Burfermet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.13,0:14:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the power of every\None of my fallen monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You did this to them when you\Nselfishly sacrificed each one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.45,0:14:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You let your rage take over. Now\Nlook into the eyes of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for\Nwhat I've done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You disrespected your monsters\NAnd it's time to pay the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,price now Your favorite\Ncards are fighting on my side
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your old pals just added\Ntheir power to my Guardian
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000 points, that's more than enough\Nto wipe you out. Now, Guardian Iatos,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy his monsters and\Nthe rest of his life points
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, Yugi actually lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,this can't be oh man yuki if he
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,lost the duel then he loses his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to pay up, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Ori Kalkos\Nnever leaves the field
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,without taking something\Nalong for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.39,0:16:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you have yourself to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you sealed your own\Nfate when you played that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your life force will awaken the\Ngreat beast. Not if I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.43,0:16:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the power of the\NMillennium Puzzle I break the seal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, I won't let this happen to you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It only needs one of us, so I'm\Nletting the seal take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be needing these anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your hands off him! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have everything of his I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.65,0:18:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, speak to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rex, I know exactly\Nwhat you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear us, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.39,0:18:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd outsmart that big goon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.03,0:18:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how'd you do it, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything all right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far from all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't outsmart him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Leviathan, please\Naccept my latest offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be talking to\Nus if he took your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not mine. Yugi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been me, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
